Employees: Id ManagerId,
    Concat(FirstName, < >, LastName) Manager,
    Department.Name Department,
    CountDistinct(Members.Id) DirectReports,
    CountDistinct(Members.LocationId) TeamLocations,
    ROUND(AVG(Members.Salary), <2>) AverageTeamSalary,
    ROUND(ReviewSummary.AverageTeamRating, <2>) AverageTeamRating,
    ROUND(SUM(Members.Salary), <2>) TeamPayroll
  Where Members.Id IS NOT NULL
  Order DirectReports ASC, TeamPayroll ASC
  Left Join ReviewSummary On Id = ReviewSummary.ManagerId
ReviewSummary is PerformanceReviews: Employee.ManagerId ManagerId, AVG(Rating) AverageTeamRating